On Oct 22, 2:00 am, dmtrkr...@gmail.com wrote:
> -What does elven dagger (+2) mean? What are those numbers near the
> weapon names?
> -Invisibility cloak - is it rare? Got 2, but they died with me (-:

The numbers after identified weapon names indicate the "enchantment"
of the weapon; higher numbers means you do more damage and will
successfully hit your target more often. More detail than you will
ever want here (caution: spoilers!): http://www.steelypips.org/nethack/341/weap-341.html

Invisibility cloaks are pretty rare, yes. According to the spoilers
they are one of the more common randomly-generated cloaks, but
randomly-generated cloaks aren't that common unless you find a big
armor store; most of the armor you come across will be dropped by
monsters, and most types of monsters rarely have "magical" armor in
their starting kit. There is at least one type of monster that *is*
usually generated with magical armor, but still not likely to have a
cloak of invisibility...

